<view class="page {{role === 'owner' ? 'me-lost' : 'me-found'}}">
  <view class="item card">
    <image class="item-photo" src="{{item.photo}}" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="item-body">
      <view class="item-title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <view class="quiet">{{role === 'owner' ? '对方捡到了你的东西' : '你捡到的东西，对方是失主'}}</view>
      <view class="quiet">{{counterpart.count > 0 ? '对方评分 ' + counterpart.rating + ' 分 · ' + counterpart.count + ' 次评价' : '对方还没有评价记录'}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{reward.amount > 0}}" class="card reward {{role === 'owner' ? 'reward-lost' : 'reward-found'}}">
    <view class="reward-amount">感谢金 ¥{{reward.amount}}</view>
    <view class="quiet">{{rewardText}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{escrow && role === 'owner' && status === 'approved' && (reward.status === 'none' || reward.status === 'created')}}"
          class="btn btn-lost" bindtap="payReward">支付 ¥{{reward.amount}} 托管</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'approved' && role === 'owner'}}" class="btn btn-lost confirm" bindtap="confirmReturn">我已拿回物品</view>
  <view wx:if="{{status === 'approved' && role === 'finder'}}" class="notice quiet">交接后请失主在这里点“我已拿回物品”。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{status === 'returned' && !rated}}" class="card rate">
    <view class="rate-title">{{role === 'owner' ? '东西回家了！给对方打个分吧' : '归还完成，给对方打个分吧'}}</view>
    <view class="stars">
      <view wx:for="{{[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}}" wx:key="*this" class="star {{item <= stars ? 'star-on' : ''}}"
            bindtap="pickStar" data-value="{{item}}">★</view>
    </view>
    <view class="tags">
      <view wx:for="{{tagOptions}}" wx:key="name" class="tag-option {{item.on ? 'tag-option-on' : ''}}"
            bindtap="toggleTag" data-index="{{index}}">{{item.name}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn {{role === 'owner' ? 'btn-lost' : 'btn-found'}}" bindtap="submitRating">提交评价</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{status === 'returned' && rated}}" class="notice quiet">已评价，谢谢你让这件东西回家。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{notifyEnabled && status === 'approved'}}" class="notice quiet">
    <block wx:if="{{notifyCredits > 0}}">对方回复时，微信会提醒你（还能提醒 {{notifyCredits}} 次）。</block>
    <block wx:else>现在对方回复时微信不会提醒你。<text class="link" bindtap="enableNotify">开启提醒</text></block>
  </view>

  <view class="notice quiet">
    聊天不会显示手机号。见面请选人多的公共场所；不要在见面前转账，也不要交押金。
    遇到冒领、骚扰或要钱，<text class="link" bindtap="report">举报对方</text>。
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="messages" scroll-y scroll-into-view="{{scrollTo}}">
    <view wx:if="{{!loading && messages.length === 0}}" class="quiet empty">打个招呼，约一下交接的时间和地点吧</view>
    <view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="_id" id="m-{{index}}" class="row {{item.mine ? 'row-mine' : ''}}">
      <view class="bubble {{item.mine ? 'bubble-mine' : 'bubble-other'}}">{{item.text}}</view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="quick">
    <view wx:for="{{quickReplies}}" wx:key="*this" class="quick-item" bindtap="useQuick" data-text="{{item}}">{{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="composer">
    <input class="composer-input" placeholder="发消息…" value="{{draft}}" bindinput="onDraft"
           confirm-type="send" bindconfirm="send" maxlength="500" />
    <view class="send" bindtap="send">发送</view>
  </view>
</view>
